{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-10-1","title":"Luke 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ sends out at once seventy disciples to work miracles, and to preach; 13 pronounces a woe against certain cities. 17 The seventy return with joy; he shows them wherein to rejoice, and thanks his Father for his grace; 23 magnifies the happy estate of his church; 25 teaches the lawyer how to attain eternal life, and to take every one for his neighbour that needs his mercy; 38 reprehends Martha, and commends Mary her sister.</p>\n<p>these. Mt 10:1-4; Mr 6:7-13 other seventy.Rather, seventy others, as Dr. Campbell renders; for the expression other seventy implies that there were seventy sent before, which was not the case: it seems to refer to the twelve apostles whom our Lord had previously chosen.</p>\n<p>Nu 11:16,24-26 two and. Ac 13:2-4; Re 11:3-10 whither. 1:17,76; 3:4-6; 9:52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-2","title":"Luke 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>The harvest. Mt 9:37,38; Joh 4:35-38; 1Co 3:6-9 the labourers. Mt 20:1; Mr 13:34; 1Co 15:10; 2Co 6:1; Php 2:25,30; Col 1:29; 4:12 1Th 2:9; 5:12; 1Ti 4:10,15,16; 5:17,18; 2Ti 2:3-6; 4:5; Phm 1:1 are. 1Ki 18:22; 22:6-8; Isa 56:9-12; Eze 34:2-6; Zec 11:5,17; Mt 9:36 Ac 16:9,10; Php 2:21; Re 11:2,3 pray. 2Th 3:1 the Lord. 9:1; Nu 11:17,29; Ps 68:11; Jer 3:15; Mr 16:15,20; Ac 8:4; 11:19 Ac 13:2,4; 20:28; 22:21; 26:15-18; 1Co 12:28; Eph 4:7-12 1Ti 1:12-14; Heb 3:6; Re 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-3","title":"Luke 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>I send. Ps 22:12-16,21; Eze 2:3-6; Mt 10:16,22; Joh 15:20; 16:2; Ac 9:2,16 wolves. Zep 3:3; Mt 7:15; Joh 10:12; Ac 20:29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-4","title":"Luke 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>neither. 9:3-6; 22:35; Mt 10:9,10; Mr 6:8,9 and. 9:59,60; Ge 24:33,56; 1Sa 21:8; 2Ki 4:24,29; Pr 4:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-5","title":"Luke 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>19:9; 1Sa 25:6; Isa 57:19; Mt 10:12,13; Ac 10:36; 2Co 5:18-20 Eph 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-6","title":"Luke 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the Son. 1Sa 25:17; Isa 9:6; Eph 2:2,3; 5:6; 2Th 3:16; 1Pe 1:14; *Gr: Jas 3:18 it shall. Ps 35:13; 2Co 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-7","title":"Luke 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>in. 9:4; Mt 10:11; Mr 6:10; Ac 16:15,34,40 for. De 12:12,18,19; Mt 10:10; 1Co 9:4-15; Ga 6:6; Php 4:17,18 1Ti 5:17,18; 2Ti 2:6; 3Jo 1:5-8 Go. 1Ti 5:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-8","title":"Luke 10:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>and. 10; 9:48; Mt 10:40; Joh 13:20 eat. 1Co 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-9","title":"Luke 10:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>heal. 9:2; Mt 10:8; Mr 6:13; Ac 28:7-10 The kingdom. 11; 17:20,21; Da 2:44; Mt 3:2; 4:17; 10:7; Mr 4:30; Joh 3:3,5 Ac 28:28,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-10","title":"Luke 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>go. 9:5; Mt 10:14; Ac 13:51; 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-10-11","title":"Luke 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":10